  "ingredients": [
    "2 cup almond flour (sifted)",
    "1/4 cup butter",
    "1 large egg",
    "1/4 cup cream cheese (room temperature)",
    "1/3 cup allulose",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon xanthan gum",
    "1 1/4 cup pecans (chopped)",
    "5 tablespoon butter",
    "1/2 cup allulose",
    "1/3 cup heavy cream",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "salt (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all of your ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat together the cream cheese, butter, and allulose until pale.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the egg and vanilla, then beat again until completely incorporated.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the almond flour, baking powder, and xanthan gum.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together again until smooth and no lumps are present.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the dough in plastic wrap and refrigerate for 20-30 minutes to firm up.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once ready, pre-heat your oven to 325F. Line a baking sheet with parchment paper and form dough into 1.5-inch balls. Place the balls down on the sheet, then press an indentation into the cookies by using your thumb or the back of a spoon. Bake the cookies for 15-18 minutes or until lightly golden.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While cookies are baking, add chopped pecans to a pan over medium-low and toast for 3-4 minutes until fragrant.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate saucepan, combine the butter and allulose over medium heat until bubbling and shiny. Stir frequently to prevent burning.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the toasted pecans, heavy cream, cinnamon, vanilla, and salt to taste. Stir together until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once cookie bases have cooled, generously spoon the pecan pie filling into each of the indentations.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Keto-Pecan-Pie-Cookies-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Store in an air-tight container and enjoy as desired! Keep at room-temp for up to a week.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pecan-pie-cookies/#wprm-recipe-57571-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
